<PageTitle>About — Cineclay</PageTitle><section class="form-panel" style="margin:40px auto"><h1>For the love of cinema.</h1><p>Cineclay is an independent movie discovery and review application. The catalog can combine curated demonstration films, publicly scraped Wikipedia American and Hindi release-year lists, and TVmaze series. It is not a complete worldwide record. Archive-only entries may lack synopsis, genres, cast or artwork. Seed scores are sample values. Import live titles and scores in Studio.</p><p>Metadata import: <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TMDB</a>. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB. Imported streaming availability is powered by JustWatch. Artwork belongs to the respective studios and rightsholders.</p><p>Public series metadata: <a href="https://www.tvmaze.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TVmaze</a>, CC BY-SA. Wikipedia text and release lists retain their CC BY-SA attribution through each record’s source URL. Official title links are not a guarantee of regional streaming availability.</p><p>Your watchlist and personal reviews use a pseudonymous device cookie and are stored in PostgreSQL. Clearing this cookie loses access to this device’s collection. Cross-device accounts are not included.</p><p>For commercial use, obtain the applicable metadata and image licenses. Streaming availability varies by country and can change. Imported TMDB watch pages are distinguished from manually added direct OTT links.</p><p>If you reached this page after an error, return to discovery and retry. The server logs contain operational details.</p><a class="primary" href="/">Back to discovery ↗</a></section>
